(5686282, 827310, 20781, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this, but it''s kind of distracting that the brightest object in the frame is also the least in focus.  <br/> <br/>Did you shoot one where the ball is sharp?</td>', 'I like the composition of this, but it''s kind of distracting that the brightest object in the frame is also the least in focus.   Did you shoot one where the ball is sharp?', '2009-10-14 01:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
