(5686299, 827310, 64446, '<td valign="top">A good idea: both the man and girl on left are engaged in the action.<br/>There ar a couple of things here that could improve a lot the image: (1) The half-girl at the right is a no-no. She does not add anything to the image. Croppin her out would keep the viewer looking on what matters. (2) The white balance seems off to me: for example, his face is too greenish (Ok, it could be the reflection of the table, but still would be better if corrected).</td>', 'A good idea: both the man and girl on left are engaged in the action.There ar a couple of things here that could improve a lot the image: (1) The half-girl at the right is a no-no. She does not add anything to the image. Croppin her out would keep the viewer looking on what matters. (2) The white balance seems off to me: for example, his face is too greenish (Ok, it could be the reflection of the table, but still would be better if corrected).', '2009-10-14 01:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5686326, 826959, 110292, '<td valign="top">Spiral?  Spiral....  SPIRAL!!<br/> <br/>Wonderful.  Lighting, focus, composition...  wonderful.</td>', 'Spiral?  Spiral....  SPIRAL!! Wonderful.  Lighting, focus, composition...  wonderful.', '2009-10-14 02:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5686330, 827355, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful photo with good focus, composition, and lighting.  The problem is that I can''t tell that it meets the challenge.  There is no way to know if this is natural or aritificial lighting.</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful photo with good focus, composition, and lighting.  The problem is that I can''t tell that it meets the challenge.  There is no way to know if this is natural or aritificial lighting.', '2009-10-14 02:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5686348, 827540, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think if you were to cool down the white balance, this photo would score a lot higher.  I would also crop along the bottom of the photo to just include the heah of little girl on the left.</td>', 'I think if you were to cool down the white balance, this photo would score a lot higher.  I would also crop along the bottom of the photo to just include the heah of little girl on the left.', '2009-10-14 02:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5686350, 827683, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think i would like this photo if her hair was as blown out (high key) as the rest of her.  The contrast between her hair and face is a bit severe.</td>', 'I think i would like this photo if her hair was as blown out (high key) as the rest of her.  The contrast between her hair and face is a bit severe.', '2009-10-14 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
