(5686353, 826795, 108525, '<td valign="top">He seems to be a tad out of focus.  I would also like to see him farther to the right of the photo.</td>', 'He seems to be a tad out of focus.  I would also like to see him farther to the right of the photo.', '2009-10-14 02:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
