(5687014, 827028, 73981, '<td valign="top">I am sure you used sparklers...I was going to do something with sparklers and people but got lazy. I look at this and I''m definitely going to do something with sparklers the next time around when light is the subject.<br/> <br/>I think you did an amazing job here. I predict a blue or a close tie to a blue with one other entry I like as blue. If not, then most definitely a red.<br/> <br/>Good luck!!</td>', 'I am sure you used sparklers...I was going to do something with sparklers and people but got lazy. I look at this and I''m definitely going to do something with sparklers the next time around when light is the subject. I think you did an amazing job here. I predict a blue or a close tie to a blue with one other entry I like as blue. If not, then most definitely a red. Good luck!!', '2009-10-14 12:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687019, 827312, 73981, '<td valign="top">I predict at least a top 10 finish.<br/> <br/>While I don''t see the blue being your ribbon, I most certainly see a red or yellow. There are only 2 other entries I can see beating this, but this is certainly far better than the rest. I hope you do well...</td>', 'I predict at least a top 10 finish. While I don''t see the blue being your ribbon, I most certainly see a red or yellow. There are only 2 other entries I can see beating this, but this is certainly far better than the rest. I hope you do well...', '2009-10-14 12:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687020, 827699, 73981, '<td valign="top">Top 10 finish. I see maybe a red or a yellow. I have 3 other entries I prefer, so this I see as being my 4th in line. I hope you ribbon. There is absolutely nothing wrong with this shot at all. All the best for this challenge.</td>', 'Top 10 finish. I see maybe a red or a yellow. I have 3 other entries I prefer, so this I see as being my 4th in line. I hope you ribbon. There is absolutely nothing wrong with this shot at all. All the best for this challenge.', '2009-10-14 12:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
