(5687544, 827519, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I was thinking of doing something very similar. The only thing I may have done different would be to use an incandesant light instead of a flash.  This would better match the temp of the garage lights, and make your white balance look a bit more even.  The subects body is very cold, but the rest of the scene is very warm.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I was thinking of doing something very similar. The only thing I may have done different would be to use an incandesant light instead of a flash.  This would better match the temp of the garage lights, and make your white balance look a bit more even.  The subects body is very cold, but the rest of the scene is very warm.', '2009-10-14 19:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687554, 827226, 108525, '<td valign="top">The blown out areas one the subjects forehead and shoulder are very distracting.</td>', 'The blown out areas one the subjects forehead and shoulder are very distracting.', '2009-10-14 19:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687555, 827697, 30454, '<td valign="top">Commonly photographed object on DPC. But excellent execution, great control over light and flawles under Basic processing boundries. 9</td>', 'Commonly photographed object on DPC. But excellent execution, great control over light and flawles under Basic processing boundries. 9', '2009-10-14 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687634, 827658, 108525, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I think I would have tried to cover the whole back window with the reflection.</td>', 'Great colors!  I think I would have tried to cover the whole back window with the reflection.', '2009-10-14 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687647, 827573, 108525, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the green grass and the bright red covered couch. It''s a good abstract concept.  The problem lies with the models'' attire.  It doesn''t work itself into the concept well.  I think I would have went with an earth tone color cover or dressed the models abstractly.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the green grass and the bright red covered couch. It''s a good abstract concept.  The problem lies with the models'' attire.  It doesn''t work itself into the concept well.  I think I would have went with an earth tone color cover or dressed the models abstractly.', '2009-10-14 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687651, 827700, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Is there anything that can get better in this photo... this is just awesome... getting two drops side by side, with such a beautiful combination of colors and that great background is a real achievement. A ribbon is for sure... i hope you would be knowing by now, how well this image is going to do... Great work...!!!</td>', 'Wow!!! Is there anything that can get better in this photo... this is just awesome... getting two drops side by side, with such a beautiful combination of colors and that great background is a real achievement. A ribbon is for sure... i hope you would be knowing by now, how well this image is going to do... Great work...!!!', '2009-10-14 19:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687662, 827435, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love this! it is similar to one of my intial ideas.  I think I would have included more of the light so that it made a full circle above Arthur.  I think I would have possibly blew some baby-powder or the like into the light stream to give it the feeling "message from God".</td>', 'I love this! it is similar to one of my intial ideas.  I think I would have included more of the light so that it made a full circle above Arthur.  I think I would have possibly blew some baby-powder or the like into the light stream to give it the feeling "message from God".', '2009-10-14 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687668, 827619, 108525, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this photo.  I''m a minimalist by nature.  I think I would have placed the "love" in the lower left hand corner rather than the right.  The writing is leaning to the right, and pulls my eyes with it.  This creates more of an empty dead space feeling on the other side of it.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this photo.  I''m a minimalist by nature.  I think I would have placed the "love" in the lower left hand corner rather than the right.  The writing is leaning to the right, and pulls my eyes with it.  This creates more of an empty dead space feeling on the other side of it.', '2009-10-14 20:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687684, 827295, 108525, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and composition. I feel that fire is more of a natural light.</td>', 'Great exposure and composition. I feel that fire is more of a natural light.', '2009-10-14 20:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687703, 827506, 108525, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I think I would try playing with the color levels and/or the tonal curve.  I think you could bring out a lot more depth in the subjects face.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I think I would try playing with the color levels and/or the tonal curve.  I think you could bring out a lot more depth in the subjects face.', '2009-10-14 20:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687706, 827696, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract nature of this photo.  I think the fish is lacking clarity.</td>', 'I love the abstract nature of this photo.  I think the fish is lacking clarity.', '2009-10-14 20:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687712, 827624, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love all the colors.  It is however very busy.  hard to tell what exactly what is your actual subject being illuminated.</td>', 'I love all the colors.  It is however very busy.  hard to tell what exactly what is your actual subject being illuminated.', '2009-10-14 20:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687716, 827576, 108525, '<td valign="top">A tough shot to capture.  I think I would have went one way or the other with the color saturation.  Either faint subdued colors or bright, jump out at you, intense colors.  A monochromatic would have been cool too.</td>', 'A tough shot to capture.  I think I would have went one way or the other with the color saturation.  Either faint subdued colors or bright, jump out at you, intense colors.  A monochromatic would have been cool too.', '2009-10-14 20:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687867, 827636, 108525, '<td valign="top">Great exposure. I love how the tones of the subject are complimented by those in the background.</td>', 'Great exposure. I love how the tones of the subject are complimented by those in the background.', '2009-10-14 22:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687894, 827534, 108525, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I think I would have eiter included the T.V. into the photo, or cropped closer in on the right side.</td>', 'Great idea!  I think I would have eiter included the T.V. into the photo, or cropped closer in on the right side.', '2009-10-14 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
