(5690294, 827573, 58272, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here but the overall scene seems a little awkward to me. It''s almost as if you''re expecting to be seeing them watching a movie at an outdoor cinema, yet they are looking in the wrong direction vs light for that. I think it might be worth experimenting with a closer crop and b&amp;w processing (you''d get a great range of tones I think)</td>', 'I like the idea here but the overall scene seems a little awkward to me. It''s almost as if you''re expecting to be seeing them watching a movie at an outdoor cinema, yet they are looking in the wrong direction vs light for that. I think it might be worth experimenting with a closer crop and b&w processing (you''d get a great range of tones I think)', '2009-10-17 06:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
