(5694960, 827204, 46918, '<td valign="top">The pic seems a little blurry. That could, however, be the waythat the light is hitting it. Another thing I prob would have done for this subject matter is to hold the camera straight. Keep it up and the next one will be better.</td>', 'The pic seems a little blurry. That could, however, be the waythat the light is hitting it. Another thing I prob would have done for this subject matter is to hold the camera straight. Keep it up and the next one will be better.', '2009-10-21 09:36:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5694970, 827028, 35357, '<td valign="top">Cool, way to go! :-O</td>', 'Cool, way to go! :-O', '2009-10-21 09:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5694996, 827625, 15711, '<td valign="top">One of my higher rated images.  Kind of made me think of the old Memorex commercials with the guy''s hair blowing from the sound coming out of the speaker.</td>', 'One of my higher rated images.  Kind of made me think of the old Memorex commercials with the guy''s hair blowing from the sound coming out of the speaker.', '2009-10-21 09:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695005, 827624, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the busyness of this.   I gave it an 8, and am glad to see that it''s yours, Penny.   Good stuff.</td>', 'I like the busyness of this.   I gave it an 8, and am glad to see that it''s yours, Penny.   Good stuff.', '2009-10-21 10:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695060, 827204, 109478, '<td valign="top">This photo meets the basic "rule of third", that''s good. However, there are some flaws in my opinion:<br/> <br/>1. The tower looks a little out of focus or blur.<br/> <br/>2. If you want to shoot it in tilted angle, you can do it more dramatically to give more impact. <br/> <br/>3. The triangle part in lower left and Those little light spots in background are disturbing. <br/> <br/>Hope this opinions could help you. :)</td>', 'This photo meets the basic "rule of third", that''s good. However, there are some flaws in my opinion: 1. The tower looks a little out of focus or blur. 2. If you want to shoot it in tilted angle, you can do it more dramatically to give more impact.  3. The triangle part in lower left and Those little light spots in background are disturbing.  Hope this opinions could help you. :)', '2009-10-21 10:18:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695061, 827028, 86447, '<td valign="top">So well done!   I really like this... gave it an 8.  Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'So well done!   I really like this... gave it an 8.  Congrats on your ribbon!', '2009-10-21 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695065, 827700, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Ribbon!!</td>', 'Congrats on your Ribbon!!', '2009-10-21 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695066, 827446, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2009-10-21 10:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695084, 827028, 109389, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites. Congrats.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites. Congrats.', '2009-10-21 10:24:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695160, 827028, 79720, '<td valign="top">Damn! That is so freakin'' awesome. Major congratulations on the Blue. I like how someone thinks sparklers are natural light, and voted a 1. And props to Jon for having the stones to let you get that close to his ride with fissionable material. <b>:</b>-P</td>', 'Damn! That is so freakin'' awesome. Major congratulations on the Blue. I like how someone thinks sparklers are natural light, and voted a 1. And props to Jon for having the stones to let you get that close to his ride with fissionable material. :-P', '2009-10-21 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695168, 826305, 83544, '<td valign="top">I was wondering how this photo will finish, and how many low-minded commenteers there are who are mentioning the "Out of Focus" thing without thinking little bit about the idea and title connection to the blurriness. I know the start is always difficult but I encourage you not to give up easily and keep sending photos to the contests. I hope to see you more ideas and catchy photos from you in near future. Cheers</td>', 'I was wondering how this photo will finish, and how many low-minded commenteers there are who are mentioning the "Out of Focus" thing without thinking little bit about the idea and title connection to the blurriness. I know the start is always difficult but I encourage you not to give up easily and keep sending photos to the contests. I hope to see you more ideas and catchy photos from you in near future. Cheers', '2009-10-21 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695201, 826528, 83544, '<td valign="top">considering your type of camera which is not your strong side you should try taking photos on sunny days with the highest resolution 6mp, and when sending then try to edit in some program and make the resolution 640x480. Try Gimp it''s free. I''m not sure that you can achive a good handheld night shot with this type of camera. I hope you will not give up easily and you''ll keep psoting photos. Good luck and still congrats on the brown ribbon</td>', 'considering your type of camera which is not your strong side you should try taking photos on sunny days with the highest resolution 6mp, and when sending then try to edit in some program and make the resolution 640x480. Try Gimp it''s free. I''m not sure that you can achive a good handheld night shot with this type of camera. I hope you will not give up easily and you''ll keep psoting photos. Good luck and still congrats on the brown ribbon', '2009-10-21 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695250, 827619, 83544, '<td valign="top">It seems love doesn''t conquer all :(, I''m sad that this photo didn''t finish highter, I''ve mentioned you in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058&amp;page=6#5695234" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a></td>', 'It seems love doesn''t conquer all :(, I''m sad that this photo didn''t finish highter, I''ve mentioned you in Posthumous Ribbons', '2009-10-21 11:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
