(5695747, 827555, 110319, '<td valign="top">I''m pleased with this result. I actually only took this to get some use out of my new tripod, but I thought I may as well enter. As far as the suggestions for more zoom are concerned, I was (still am!) lens-constrained here. The water is a flowing river rather than anything still, so a longer exposure didn''t gain any better reflection. And as far as the picture being very dark, that''s what drew me towards it. At first glance it looks completely black, but then you can gradually pick out a bit of texture in the trees.</td>', 'I''m pleased with this result. I actually only took this to get some use out of my new tripod, but I thought I may as well enter. As far as the suggestions for more zoom are concerned, I was (still am!) lens-constrained here. The water is a flowing river rather than anything still, so a longer exposure didn''t gain any better reflection. And as far as the picture being very dark, that''s what drew me towards it. At first glance it looks completely black, but then you can gradually pick out a bit of texture in the trees.', '2009-10-21 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5695797, 827700, 93934, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. I have tried a few times, but can now see I stopped too soon. Will have to keep trying. Well done.</td>', 'This is stunning. I have tried a few times, but can now see I stopped too soon. Will have to keep trying. Well done.', '2009-10-21 14:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
