(5712075, 827479, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think the biggest thing you "missed" here is lighting his eyes.  I like the pose, the open book, the fact we can see the illustrations in the book.  The background is a bit busy, and a bit more fill on the left to counter the shadow would help.  But mostly you need to get some light into his eyes.</td>', 'I think the biggest thing you "missed" here is lighting his eyes.  I like the pose, the open book, the fact we can see the illustrations in the book.  The background is a bit busy, and a bit more fill on the left to counter the shadow would help.  But mostly you need to get some light into his eyes.', '2009-11-03 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5728417, 827545, 73981, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by david_c:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t get it...you''ve listed the 7D as the camera, but a Nikkor as the lens. Who are you, MacGyver? <b>;</b>-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes.</td>', 'Originally posted by david_c: I don''t get it...you''ve listed the 7D as the camera, but a Nikkor as the lens. Who are you, MacGyver? ;-)   Yes.', '2009-11-15 23:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
