(6462837, 827597, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great lines; superb blues. There is an explosive feeling of movement here from the inside out-blending the mechanical architectural shapes with almost that of the underlying flower shape below. perhaps it signifies that both flowers and steel have elemental cores, really boil down to the same thing. perhaps i am reading too much into it; perhaps not.</td>', 'Great lines; superb blues. There is an explosive feeling of movement here from the inside out-blending the mechanical architectural shapes with almost that of the underlying flower shape below. perhaps it signifies that both flowers and steel have elemental cores, really boil down to the same thing. perhaps i am reading too much into it; perhaps not.', '2011-07-06 09:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
